  "body": "Experience the ultimate in luxurious living by building your dream home on Codrington Crescent, one of Mission Bay's most sought-after streets.\r\n\r\n17/42 Codrington Crescent is 600m² land area and 40a Codrington Crescent is 879m² land area, total is 1479m². With a building term available if needed, with approved resource consent if needed, or design and construct a home that perfectly suits your vision. The ease of living in this location is a blessing, offering a harmonious blend of convenience and luxury.\r\n\r\nCodrington Crescent offers an enviable location with exceptional access to the best amenities in the Mission Bay. Whether you seek shopping, recreation, or dining, everything is within reach: Eastridge Shopping Centre, Kepa Reserve, Mission Bay and Kohimarama Promenades, and major public transport routes. The sections at 40A Codrington Crescent and 17/42 Codrington Crescent are situated in a quiet neighborhood that enhances the tranquility of your living experience. Additionally, you’ll find a delightful selection of cafes, restaurants, and the iconic Movenpick Ice Cream shop within walking distance. The proximity to the beach further enriches the leisurely lifestyle Mission Bay is famous for.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the zoning for top-tier educational institutions, including Kohimarama School and Selwyn College\r\n\r\nThis is not just an opportunity to build a house; it's a chance to be part of an extraordinary development in one of Auckland's most desirable areas. The lifestyle, community, and amenities on offer in Mission Bay make this an unbeatable proposition. Don’t miss out on this fantastic opportunity to secure your future in stunning Mission Bay. Build your dream house in this prime area and experience the best that coastal living has to offer.\r\n\r\nCall us now to learn more about these exceptional sections and take the first step towards making your dream home a reality.",
